<title>POLAND: GRAJEWO MAY NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>GRAJEWO MAY NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.09 vs   0.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.87 vs   1.46</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.47 vs   1.79</p>
<p> Sales		   18.03 vs  14.98</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.37 vs   8.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	14.55 vs  13.68</p>
<p> Operating profit    14.18 vs  15.24</p>
<p> Sales		  109.38 vs  92.83</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish chipboard producer is Zaklady</p>
<p>Plyt Wiorowych Grajewo SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
